cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RACH, please cite the software and associated methods manuscript."
title: "RACH: Restricted Admissible Causal Hypotheses"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Ruiqi
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zuizui0223/microdonta"
abstract: >-
  RACH is a constraint-aware framework for retaining ecological mechanisms
  compatible with declared observations, quantifying residual causal degeneracy,
  and prioritising the next observation by validated mechanism-observation
  mutual information.
keywords:
  - causal admissibility
  - causal degeneracy
  - ecological mechanism inference
  - approximate Bayesian computation
  - mutual information
  - observation design
